          <div class="cs2-row__body">
            <p>Across the four branches, Nuad Thai Spa now runs roughly 350 bookings and 170 recorded payments a week through Zennly, with every discount request and staff transfer carrying its own audit trail. Nothing about the business got simpler &ndash; four branches, 39 therapists and 194 services is still a lot to run. What changed is that the owner sees it as one operation instead of four held together by phone calls.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
